# Environment every Moon task runs with. Committed, so nothing secret here.

# Off the working tree: an in-tree `target/` falls inside pricing_native's
# `native/**/*` input glob, and CI caches $HOME/.cache between runs. pricing,
# pricing_native and server share one directory, so one build serves all three;
# moon-elixir-plugin overrides it with a nested one its plugin test harness
# resolves against.
CARGO_TARGET_DIR=$HOME/.cache/baalbek-cargo-target
